ne17Pro-iPhone17Pro","iPhone17ProMax-iPhone17ProMax","iPhone17-iPhone17","iPhoneAir-iPhoneAir","iPadPro11M5-iPadPro11M5","iPadPro11M5Cellular-iPadPro11M5Cellular","iPadPro13M5-iPadPro13M5","iPadPro13M5Cellular-iPadPro13M5Cellular","iPhone17e-iPhone17e","iPadAir11M4-iPadAir11M4","iPadAir11M4Cellular-iPadAir11M4Cellular","iPadAir13M4-iPadAir13M4","iPadAir13M4Cellular-iPadAir13M4Cellular"],"kind":"software","averageUserRating":4.59235,"averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.59235,"sellerUrl":"https://www.nordnet.se","languageCodesISO2A":["DA","EN","FI","NB","SV"],"contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","minimumOsVersion":"16.4","fileSizeBytes":"153600000","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":49960,"trackContentRating":"4+","trackCensoredName":"Nordnet: Stocks & Funds","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/nordnet-stocks-funds/id345038631?uo=4","artistId":335774758,"artistName":"Nordnet","genres":["Finance","Business"],"price":0.0,"releaseDate":"2010-01-21T08:00:00Z","trackId":345038631,"trackName":"Nordnet: Stocks & Funds","genreIds":["6015","6000"],"primaryGenreName":"Finance","primaryGenreId":6015,"sellerName":"Nordnet Bank AB","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-08-28T21:21:41Z","releaseNotes":"Every week we strive to improve the Nordnet app with new features. Make sure to enable automatic updates so you don't miss important features that take your savings to the next level.","version":"24.41.0","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Nordnet's products and services are available in Denmark, Finland, Norway and Sweden. With Nordnet's award-winning app, investing in stocks, funds, and ETFs is easier than ever. In the app you can track your progress and what is happening on the stock market. It's completely free to download and use the app.\n\n• We offer trading in stocks, funds, and other securities at low fees on several of the world's largest exchanges.\n\n• Discover new investments through top and theme lists, articles, and current campaigns.\n\n• See discussions about investing and specific stocks and funds from our users.\n\n• Follow your holdings and the stock market's development in real-time.\n\n\n\nGET STARTED IN THREE MINUTES.\n\nCreate an account directly in the app. Deposit your money easily and secure to start trading and investing.\n\n\n\nLOW FEES FOR TRADING AND INVESTING.\n\nAlways low fees regardless of how little or much you trade. Choose the commission class that fits your trading.\n\n\n\nAUTOMATIC MONTHLY INVESTING.\n\nSave automatically each month in funds. Get help choosing a fund plan that suits you.\n\n\n\nWIDE RANGE OF STOCKS AND FUNDS.\n\nChoose from thousands of stocks and funds on multiple exchanges around the world. Get inspired by other investors' stock holdings or choose funds based on your savings goals: sustainable, low fees, or highest returns.\n\n\n\nREAL-TIME PRICE ALERTS.\n\nGet a push notification when your watched stocks and other securities reach the level you have set.\n\n\n\nWATCHLISTS.\n\nFind your next investment through our watchlists. Choose industries that interest you and then get lists of instruments within those themes. Use it as inspiration to find new investments or to keep an eye on exciting companies. You can also create your own watchlists.\n\n\n\nLISTEN AND READ REPORTS WITH QUARTR.\n\nIn partnership with Quartr, you can easily keep track of your favorite stocks by listening to company presentations during quarterly and annual reports. You can also download reports and presentations in text format.\n\n\n\nINTERACTIVE GRAPHS.\n\nCompare your investments with relevant indexes and see how you perform over time. See features for more advanced investors, such as trading volume and candlesticks.\n\n\n\nSAFE AND EASY.\n\nLog in with Touch-ID or Face-ID. Hide your balance if you, for example, want to log in in public environments.\n\n\n\nABOUT NORDNET.\n\nWe are a leading Nordic digital broker for savings and investments with over 2 million customers in Sweden, Finland, Norway, and Denmark.\n\n\n\nThrough innovation, simplicity, and transparency, we challenge traditional structures and give private savers access to the same information, tools, and services as professional investors. Welcome to Nordnet.","bundleId":"com.nordnet.Nordnet","userRatingCount":49960}